      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I strongly advise against making any definitive statement right now, as anything you say could be used against the company later. A careful, non-committal holding statement is the best tactical approach for the immediate press inquiry. You should tell the news outlet that \"we are aware of the importance of data security and are currently in the process of a thorough, internal review of all system activities to ensure the integrity of our data.\" This acknowledges the query without confirming any breach.",
